  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An electric motor with an efficiency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\eta\"></span> is used to raise a load of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> at a constant vertical speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>. Which of the following represents the electrical power input to the motor?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\eta m g v\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{m g v}{\\eta}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{m g}{\\eta v}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\eta}{m g v}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
